C[Lee Chang-ho's Selected Life and Death Go Problems

This is a collection of 727 problems from Lee Chang-ho's Selected Life and Death Go Problems, originally published as a six-volume series. The problems become more difficult as one proceeds through the volumes. All the problems are black to move.
Enjoy solving the problems and developing your reading skills.
 - Vit Brunner
